OL,3,AParents could lose benefits or face
OL,4,Aprison for child's crimes, minister
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FParents could lose their benefits or
OL,8,Fface prison sentences for their
OL,9,Fchildren's crimes under reforms to the
OL,10,Fyouth justice system, a minister has
OL,11,Fsaid.
OL,13,FYouth Justice Minister Jake Richards
OL,14,Ftold the Times newspaper the system
OL,15,F"should hold parents to account in a
OL,16,Fproportionate way for ensuring that
OL,17,Fthey play their role in keeping
OL,18,Fcommunities safe".
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
