OL,3,ATrump says he is banning CNN and
OL,4,APolitico from White House
OL,5,
OL,6,FCNN swiftly slammed the move as an
OL,7,F"illegal assault" on American press
OL,8,Ffreedoms. The move by Trump is likely
OL,9,Fto be met with legal challenges.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
